tags: Documentation [[HyperGSD API]]
title: System Tags

System tags are the integration surface: tag your tiddler and the framework picks it up. All HyperGSD hooks live under `$:/tags/hypergsd/` (plus the type tags under `$:/GSD/`).

! Hook families

;[[$:/tags/hypergsd/Type|Type tag list]]
:Register a new item type.
;[[$:/tags/hypergsd/Capture|Capture sidebar hooks]]
:Add a "new (thing)" entry button, or a defaults control, to the capture sidebar — the review sidebar takes entries the same way over `$:/tags/hypergsd/Review`.
;[[$:/tags/hypergsd/AfterCreation|AfterCreation]]
:Run a rule after every item creation.
;[[$:/tags/hypergsd/PanelTemplate|PanelTemplate]]
:Add a section to the attributes panel.
;[[$:/tags/hypergsd/ModalTemplate|ModalTemplate]]
:Add a section to the new-item modal.
;[[$:/tags/hypergsd/Fragment/Row/Prefix|Fragments]] and [[$:/tags/hypergsd/Fragment/Row/Suffix|Fragments]]
:Add a fragment to every list row, before or after the title.
;`$:/tags/hypergsd/Fragment/Link/<family>` (open set — shipped: `Link/Action`, `Link/Project`)
:Add a read-only adornment after GSD links on the surfaces that host the family (the link-target counterpart of the Row placements).
;[[$:/tags/hypergsd/GroupBy|Grouping dimensions]] and [[$:/tags/hypergsd/SortBy|Sorting dimensions]]
:Contribute a grouping dimension or sort expression to `$hgsd.list`'s view strip.
;[[$:/tags/hypergsd/Lists/Dashboard|Dashboard tag lists]] and friends
:Add a list block to a dashboard (visibility-gated).
;`$:/tags/hypergsd/ProjectView`
:Add a section to the project page's panel (next/waiting/future/subprojects/completed ship as its five members; the References sub-plugin adds a sixth). Same Portion/N + Top/Full placement vocabulary as the section tag lists; visibility under `$:/config/hypergsd/ProjectView/visibility/<member>`.
;`$:/tags/hypergsd/Settings` and `$:/tags/hypergsd/Settings/List`
:Add a tab to Settings → HyperGSD (a `list-after` field positions it; `Settings/List` tabs render inside the Dashboards tab's tab strip).
;`/Portion/N`, `/Portion/Top`, `/Portion/Full` suffixes
:Any section or list tag's placement vocabulary: portions render side by side (untagged members land in Portion/1), the two bands bracket the row full-width. Managed from each Settings draggable's Portion picker.
;[[$:/tags/hypergsd/Convert/Warning|Convert warnings]]
:Add a warning sentence to the action→project convert confirmation (optional conditions filter; ship from a plugin to gate on its presence).
;[[$:/tags/hypergsd/Complete/Warning|Completion warnings]]
:Add a confirmation warning when an item is marked complete (conditions filter; the tag tiddler's `list` field is the active set, so removal is a list edit).
;[[$:/tags/KeyboardShortcut|Keyboard shortcuts]]
:Bind a keyboard shortcut (core tag; HyperGSD ships four triggers).

Ordering within a hook is alphabetical by default; create or edit the tag tiddler and set its `list` field to control it (the tag list and the Row/Suffix placement tags ship with `list` fields).